pleasant|enjoyable|ADJECTIVE|giving comfort or enjoyment|Giving a feeling of enjoyment, comfort, or satisfaction.|dễ chịu; thú vị|A pleasant breeze cooled the room after lunch.|Một làn gió dễ chịu làm căn phòng mát hơn sau bữa trưa.|Before a noun or after a linking verb; pleasant describes something enjoyable rather than someone experiencing pleasure.|0
site|physical-location|NOUN|place used for an activity|A place where something stands, happens, or is planned to be built.|địa điểm; khu đất|The old factory site will become a public garden.|Khu đất của nhà máy cũ sẽ trở thành một khu vườn công cộng.|Countable; site of an event or site for a building specifies the use or association.|0
site|website|NOUN|collection of linked online pages|A website or collection of related pages available online.|trang web; website|The charity's site lists places where volunteers are needed.|Trang web của tổ chức từ thiện liệt kê những nơi cần tình nguyện viên.|Countable; visit a site describes online access here, not physical travel.|1
worldwide|global-adjective|ADJECTIVE|extending across the world|Extending to many parts of the world.|trên toàn thế giới|The photograph attracted worldwide attention.|Bức ảnh thu hút sự chú ý trên toàn thế giới.|Adjective before a noun; worldwide attention describes the geographical reach of interest.|0
worldwide|global-adverb|ADVERB|throughout the world|In or to places across the world.|trên khắp thế giới|The company sends its catalogue to readers worldwide.|Công ty gửi danh mục sản phẩm cho độc giả trên khắp thế giới.|Adverb modifying distribution or activity; it does not literally require every country or individual.|1
crowd|gathered-people|NOUN|people gathered in one place|A group of people gathered closely together in a place.|đám đông|A crowd gathered outside the station to welcome the musicians.|Một đám đông tụ tập ngoài nhà ga để chào đón các nhạc công.|Countable collective noun; a crowd of people specifies its members.|0
further|additional|ADJECTIVE|additional to what already exists|More or additional beyond what has already been given or done.|thêm; bổ sung|Please contact the office for further details.|Hãy liên hệ văn phòng để biết thêm chi tiết.|Usually before a noun; further information is uncountable, while further questions is plural.|0
further|greater-distance|ADVERB|at a greater distance|At or to a distance beyond the place already reached or mentioned.|xa hơn|We walked further along the bank to find a shaded spot.|Chúng tôi đi xa hơn dọc bờ để tìm một chỗ có bóng mát.|Adverb with movement or position; this draft concerns distance rather than an additional quantity.|1
